# Build context for dashboard/Dockerfile, which builds from the repository root: only the dashboard and the app UI
# are sent, without local installs, build output, or test results. BuildKit reads this file in place of the root
# .dockerignore when the Dockerfile is dashboard/Dockerfile.
*
!dashboard
!app-ui
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vite
**/*.local
